<file:///workspace/src/main/resources/be/vlaanderen/omgeving/riepr/data/ns/riepr/riepr.ttl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The RIE-IEPR ontology defines a data model for describing industrial processes, installations, emission points, measurement points, devices, observations, operators and operation locations within the context of the RIE-IEPR system."@en .
